-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TowerHash is built on the Poseidon2b permutation over binary tower fields,
published as:

  "Poseidon(2)b: Binary Field Versions of Poseidon/Poseidon2"
  Lorenzo Grassi et al., IACR ePrint 2025/1893
  https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/1893

Jetsam instantiates that permutation with its own round constants, domain
separation tags, sponge schedule and nonce lane. The permutation itself is
unmodified in structure; Jetsam does not claim to have designed it.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The round constants, IV, MDS constants and basis-change tables in
src/jetsam_pow_hybrid_constants.cuh and src/jetsam_pow_hybrid_tables.cuh are
generated, not transcribed. tools/gen_hybrid.py derives all of them from the
Jetsam node sources and rewrites both headers; running it reproduces the files
shipped here byte for byte.
